597
00:31:59,610 --> 00:32:00,740
She's scolding you.

598
00:32:01,070 --> 00:32:02,350
She said you're a dog.

599
00:32:05,810 --> 00:32:06,610
Boring.

600
00:32:08,200 --> 00:32:09,220
This Ms. Idle Cloud is too funny.

601
00:32:09,220 --> 00:32:10,680
There's no other meaning to what I said.

602
00:32:10,680 --> 00:32:12,180
I'm just making a sentence.

603
00:32:12,180 --> 00:32:12,750
Alright.

604
00:32:12,750 --> 00:32:14,310
That's it for me today.

605
00:32:15,770 --> 00:32:17,570
