634
00:33:39,090 --> 00:33:39,640
No.

635
00:33:40,290 --> 00:33:41,420
Isn't that perfect?

636
00:33:42,030 --> 00:33:42,700
During this time,

637
00:33:42,700 --> 00:33:44,140
