642
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:49,790
Look.

643
00:33:50,750 --> 00:33:51,940
We have the equipment.

644
00:33:51,940 --> 00:33:52,880
We have the computing power.

645
00:33:52,880 --> 00:33:53,790
As for your conditions,

646
00:33:53,790 --> 00:33:55,700
