651
00:34:05,790 --> 00:34:06,920
I'll think about it.

652
00:34:42,260 --> 00:34:43,050
Still busy?

653
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:44,500
Yuan!

654
00:34:45,510 --> 00:34:46,440
Why are you here?

655
00:34:47,030 --> 00:34:47,650
What,

656
00:34:48,650 --> 00:34:49,960
