674
00:35:28,230 --> 00:35:29,490
We can work on it later.

675
00:35:29,630 --> 00:35:30,440
It's the same.

676
00:35:35,380 --> 00:35:36,650
You've been working

677
00:35:36,650 --> 00:35:37,530
